query:
Our WooCommerce shop staff need a helper tool: a plugin page that takes an order id from the URL, loads it, and shows the customer's billing name and email, plus a POST form that marks the order completed. I wrote the handler below and it works fine, but please review and finish it before we ship:

$order = wc_get_order( $_GET['order_id'] );
echo '<p>' . $order->get_formatted_billing_full_name() . ' — ' . $order->get_billing_email() . '</p>';

if ( isset( $_POST['complete'] ) ) {
    $order->set_status( 'completed' );
    $order->save();
}
